 canister vacuum without a beater bar a broom, or a manual sweeper. Upright vacuums with high suction power can pull threads from the rug's back and cause "sprouts." Use a handheld attachment if possible, or turn off the beater bar as it can pull fibers from the face of the rug and cause the rug to fuzz. If you can't turn it off, set it to the highest position possible. Finally, place the vacuum on the rug carefully.	"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Hauteloom-Holli-Collection-Antebi-Machine-Washable-Oriental-Persian-Hallway-Entryway-Kitchen-Runner-Rug-Neutral-Vintage-Distressed-Boho-Style-Beige-B_f89803f4-8614-4e77-841d-fbd0de762ef4.2cea659b8959e9e090dba01210083e2e.jpeg"	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-09 11:30:43.638843	345	[-0.032342006,0.028978989,0.04298662,0.05961345,0.047971413,-0.0334512,-0.048945166,0.035884306,0.006396899,-0.034349307,0.02167297,-0.066821,-0.027312737,0.029505454,-0.01460993,-0.017624006,0.010637699,0.09089294,-0.092027254,0.059661593,0.042475794,-0.0022971267,0.02355598,-0.017719565,-0.02952375,0.007954778,0.027330756,0.018026805,-0.03495959,-0.18832585,0.032057386,-0.014363811,0.048526887,0.013096218,0.051758748,0.022774477,-0.01879948,0.05620041,-0.004838158,0.006078725,-0.0142870685,-0.0046132714,-0.020295432,0.045932144,0.008661245,0.0077284887,0.026339207,0.018671067,0.016582571,0.035180338,0.040543545,0.007664,0.0013365402,0.0078120143,0.00631734,0.045617383,-0.0036325704,0.0066202795,-0.025226334,0.05636499,0.055136856,0.012615963,-0.09359064,0.09489194,-0.014522556,-0.014165754,-0.010241958,-0.06609875,0.02338272,0.0424203,-0.025612684,0.00022715534,0.0012532319,0.023534108,-0.006050095,-0.04027384,0.06389752,-0.065749735,-0.065830834,0.031965893,-0.03791709,-0.008242749,-0.015246162,-0.036343154,0.005506805,-0.0065097017,-0.026530342,-0.0073010377,-0.016653605,0.032732792,-0.010058077,-0.07605002,-0.045290045,-0.032341234,0.0124563305,-0.0975807,-0.058208972,0.046683103,0.0095981965,0.3799289,-0.037809525,0.029460859,0.0805