hest position possible. Finally, place the vacuum on the rug carefully.	"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Hauteloom-Emirgazi-Living-Room-Bedroom-Patio-Outdoor-Area-Rug-Global-Blue-Gray-4-3-x-5-11_4c00c041-9c72-4e1f-bc8d-9e589d6219e9.9440d8d8e24dd7e1306ca0a219c0272f.jpeg"	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-09-09 11:32:34.579764	1764	[-0.021788174,0.022116318,0.04528735,0.02557312,0.05831784,0.006129419,-0.0071794186,0.018954799,0.011537578,-0.04171979,0.0075796684,-0.034163818,0.0154394545,0.04089445,-0.023462728,0.009611195,0.027343595,0.06322204,-0.07276731,0.025720514,0.054090105,0.005786262,0.016632374,0.0022177408,-0.05442769,0.01219486,-0.0019294685,0.016049638,-0.035235718,-0.17990722,0.0029126217,-0.00067718164,0.010607902,-0.002856302,-0.017907163,0.0029295164,-0.03392742,0.030601513,-0.04085679,0.010296949,-0.023110475,0.0089366855,-0.038881335,0.02728007,-0.035688363,-0.0002326474,0.040967125,0.01822741,0.020430403,0.039238963,0.026047189,-0.033068657,-0.029909534,0.009006953,0.020314518,0.07986376,0.030211376,0.0073300046,-0.024236381,-0.01097973,0.037760593,-0.0038076101,-0.118155345,0.11198447,-0.021026494,0.010228405,-0.004813064,-0.02956234,0.059610378,0.051245295,-0.00833738,0.036674038,-0.024904082,0.014158538,0.011879973,-0.013571002,0.032013178,-0.059120987,-0.067282364,-0.0045003565,-0.017039688,0.02195272,-0.05287515,-0.02702126,0.0026940086,0.029847959,-0.014715538,-0.006613424,0.012832054,0.03281302,0.011784444,-0.048113145,-0.054911945,-0.052472256,0.0052710823,-0.08306801,-0.018612565,0.019535702,0.028152503,0.39598408,-0.038981866,0.022615626,0.066911966,-0.025949603,-0.00394077,0.04465127,0.02200402,0.056243997,0.024555147,0.026657898,-0.041756276,-0.021454325,0.0072420873,-0.045911703,-0.04944571,-0.0072977236,0.008606099,0.0110492725,-0.00049826666,-0.009166325,-0.02446478,0.022124093,0.036993522,0.012543427,0.00091274723,-0.014768993,-0.037122115,0.05098904,0.00592071,0.009349469,0.022031112,-0.05139544,-0.0005313322,0.016762326,0.03775